@startuml
title UC-009 Arrange the Preferences page
start
:The user selects Arrange my preferences;
:The Navigation page opens in the context of the user, with the sections as folders;
repeat :The user opens a section;
  if (What does the user do?) then (hide or show)
    :The change is saved as an exception of the user;
  elseif (order or move) then
    :The order or the section is saved;
  else (rename)
    :The title is saved;
  endif
repeat while (Anything else?) is (yes)
:Preferences shows the arrangement of the user;
stop
@enduml
